    author: aminmahjoub
    generate_options: no_gui
    id: engine
    output_language: python
    run_options: run
    title: WebSDR engine
    description: Board I/Q in over ZMQ; waterfall and AM/USB/LSB audio out over ZMQ; controls over XML-RPC (PROTOCOL.md)
